# onnxruntime-node (pulled in by @huggingface/transformers for local
# embeddings) downloads CUDA binaries on Linux x64 during install. The API
# runs on CPU, whose binaries ship in the package, and the CUDA download for
# 1.21.0 now returns 404, which fails every install. Skip it.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
